      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Seed the demo\n\nRun this FIRST. It publishes the two plates this demo set is built on, so every other template has a **Version to pull from** rather than a file on your disk.\n\n### Before you run it\n\n1. Copy `.env.local.example` to `.env.local` and fill in `FPT_API_SITE_URL`, `FPT_API_SCRIPT_NAME`, `FPT_API_API_KEY`.\n2. Run `/inspect-site` to write `profile.local.json`. **Nothing works before this** - every picker reads it, and without it they are all `(none)`.\n3. Set `default_project` in `profile.local.json`, then pick your project in the nodes below.\n4. Run `PYTHONPATH=src python tools/demo_setup.py --write` to create Shot `sh010` and Asset `mp_skyline` with their Tasks. It reads before it writes, so running it twice is safe.\n\n### Then\n\nPick your project in both publish nodes and hit Run. Afterwards `01`-`07` will find their plates on the site, and every Version they publish will carry `sg_ai_generated_from` back to these - which is the whole point. Publish nothing here and the chain has no root.\n\nThe clip is uploaded **untouched**: a `VideoFromFile` is already a file on disk and a deliverable is never transformed."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
